WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:13,050
Mu Ying, it’s you, it’s me, Zhang Longzai

2
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:18,290
It would be great to lead someone to suppress those bastards who want to take advantage of my young master’s drink.

3
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,600
As expected of someone who retreated from the border

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,100
My hands and feet are so nimble

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,700
I'm just here to buy wine

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,890
I don't want to conflict with you

7
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:29,890
Sorry

8
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:32,180
This restaurant belongs to me.

9
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,680
So you have already had a conflict with me.

10
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,180
We are currently in limited supply

11
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,180
We can't do your request

12
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,780
But there are exceptions to everything

13
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,780
And your former prince, the prince

14
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,780
Nature is one of the exceptions

15
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,700
Did you see

16
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,700
That couplet

17
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,860
You just have to face it

18
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:52,860
how many drinks do you want

19
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:55,060
I'll give you as much as you want

20
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,880
How is it

21
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,880
I'm not good at couplets

22
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:02,880
It can be replaced by something else such as

23
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:05,880
Poems and lyrics are waiting for you

24
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:06,880
You set the question

25
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:07,880
if you win

26
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,880
I drink some wine

27
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:12,550
You admit it, you admit it

28
00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:14,050
If you are my master, you win

29
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:15,050
from now on

30
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:16,050
Meet me

31
00:01:16,050 --> 00:01:18,050
You have to call me big brother

32
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:19,050
At the same time, give it to me

33
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:21,050
Five hundred taels of mental damages

34
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:24,750
What is the cost of peace work?

35
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:26,250
I'm here today

36
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,750
Just to buy wine

37
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:33,870
Then let's take the topic of drinking wine, okay?

38
00:01:33,870 --> 00:01:38,000
It's up to you to go first. You don't need to go first.

39
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,030
Lest my poetic ideas come out

40
00:01:40,030 --> 00:01:44,760
I'll let you run out of inspiration again

41
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,760
That being the case

42
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:49,890
Then I am indeed being unfair.

43
00:01:49,890 --> 00:01:51,890
Last night I was alone in the courtyard

44
00:01:51,890 --> 00:01:53,890
Now that I think about it

45
00:01:53,890 --> 00:01:56,340
It's quite sad

46
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:57,370
That's the case

47
00:01:57,370 --> 00:01:59,370
I'll take this as my topic
